{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KQ5kLu4-t8TWxFqjYSTWQg?scene=1&click_id=22","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:50.407799+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KQ5kLu4-t8TWxFqjYSTWQg?scene=1&click_id=22","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guYMtzJp2YMTOiau4rxsaIwPiawwInMB6rYynjiaf0k8SibuxFREhFOsOF7A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guFaph15R8UfSPHBPFj9qiaibeada1ibvyib6G22JvfW26V7tVcwHrBe2jIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>  2026</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>欢迎报考广州医科大学卫</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>生管理学院应用心理专业硕士！</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guGUlL3mUal5DEzBMd5vYJs2NhV9nbSVfpNZmupuoiaddiaX21f5xcMYow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><b><span>新学期 新征程 欢迎加入</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>在这里，通过脑电、眼动，经颅磁刺激与功能磁共振等方法技术，帮助我们捕捉心理活动的即时轨迹，更让我们深入揭示大脑运作的奥秘。通过心理疗法，我们得以借助认知行为疗法、危机心理干预、沙盘曼陀罗、表达性艺术治疗等手段，探索心灵疗愈的奥秘。医心相融的学术环境中，我们以科研探索与人文关怀并重，致力于守护心灵健康，开拓心理学与医学融合发展的新篇章。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>045400应用心理（全日制专业型硕士）-预计接收10人</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guGUlL3mUal5DEzBMd5vYJs2NhV9nbSVfpNZmupuoiaddiaX21f5xcMYow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一.应用心理</span></strong><strong><span>专业简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>广州医科大学是“双一流”建设高校，是共和国勋章获得者钟南山院士工作单位。应用心理学专业开办于2004年，是国家一流建设专业和广东省特色专业。专业影响力在中国大学专业排名中从2021年的53名提升至2025年的33名，心理学与精神病学跻身ESI全球1%。2006年开始招收应用心理相关硕士研究生，2021年获得应用心理专业硕士学位授权点和临床医学（医学人文）博士学位点。</span></span></p><p><span>应用心理学专业秉承</span><strong><span>“医心相融、德术兼修、追求卓越”</span></strong><span>的办学理念，以国家心理健康服务需求为导向，实行培养单位导师与行业导师共同指导的方式，培养具有家国情怀、国际视野和社会责任感，善于主动学习，勇于自我探索，临床实践能力突出，适应社会各相关职业领域要求的高层次、应用型专门人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二.应用心理专业硕</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>士</span></span></strong><strong><span>的专业方向介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>专业充分整合医学院校的心理、精神及神经学科资源和新技术，形成 “临床与咨询心理学”和“社区心理服务与健康促进”专业方向。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guYz1dGRiaG60BIIJicsHibNJZ0L60CgxUS1f7DNrHwelNviazicmhkqzKmKg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三.部分导师队伍 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>拥有专业教师30余人，硕士招生导师包括校内心理学背景的专业导师，也包括附属医院具有神经精神病学背景的导师，形成医学心理学研究与应用、精神心理与脑科学教研特色团队。</span></p><p><span>更多导师信息：</span></p><p><strong><span>https://wsgl.gzhmu.edu.cn/yjsjy/dsjj1/yyxlxk/wsglxy.htm</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guRl1jySHwBxcvVDIVA7ficnbktMObeVcuibpicbYbSib2qluPykRzicP7gbg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四.课程设置</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guSJGBzlEKH43aCciaCkm0Jke2iaib5qwppjPLX8AuT5kibjMPZZGDHGJr5Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><p><b><span>五.教学科研平台</span></b></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>具有省级应用心理学实验教学示范中心、市级精神疾病临床转化重点实验室、计算机仿真实验教学实验室，及沙盘游戏与心理治疗室、音乐治疗实验室、EEG/ERP实验室、眼动和测谎实验室、生物反馈实验室等独立功能实验室。面积1500多平方米。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>•</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guZkdfOibOcv37icWn2UJb4He1BZ37TiaPMMdfv4nibPPe824cJMialml7ibzg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guPlgceSmltZ7cqjF7abWrYqqFT2svopdXh3PJE6aUu50M447snciaVhQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>Concentrate</span></em></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guDcibIQTe9CZ5TDTpZRfgkKXFALKQJVIMvVV60VjZtnyLYYQnFrv9lyQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><em><strong><span>Studing</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guY55BWsAR7Td10CDibv6gqIbRcovQetau5NNtPrNHODhqocOuFCiaZqlg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guFIbicfCFu5AK1C0nt0CWAQ1MsJomgBJbhd22EqibsPwyQcpF0YRnAnQg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guGUlL3mUal5DEzBMd5vYJs2NhV9nbSVfpNZmupuoiaddiaX21f5xcMYow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六.产教融合，联合培训</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>应用心理专业硕士培养注重实践教学，与附属脑科医院、附属医院心理科、特色心理专科医院、中小学、心理咨询机构、社区建立稳定合作，提供临床辅导、心理治疗和测量等实践培训。硕士生开展朋辈咨询、团体辅导，音乐治疗、中医心理治疗、学业困难儿童干预等，促进理论与实践结合。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0gu7QqAI7DOcGsgTqeb4vmbBg9lFcJCR4CJ3YueJibyAk5VHkuTicgXxd9w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0gudyic3vtFRicYQib4ItjpAEQgA6ovOIqcz9Ye2TEA1Hic2OuNUeOtYoNJyg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guK6ICHibyicOeGqibz7PCvc554icB4ENRrugS09JnJfPG1j47Sx6uiazJ4rQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guN8Hzn7LkLFXxyXQ6rHJV9msDg3KFugBRqibbZib0icPbOX7A51u3uSmLw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七.实践与就业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>奋进 2026</span></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>专业搭建“校-企-医”全链条高水平研发平台，为专业学位硕士配备 “校内学术导师 + 校外行业导师”，深度联动附属医院心理科、精神科，助力学生将理论知识转化为临床应用与产业实践能力。就业深造双优，职业前景广阔。可攻读博士学位，毕业生深造去向涵盖英国剑桥大学、旧金山州立大学、华南师范大学、浙江大学、中山大学等国内外名校，也可在大中小学校、医疗机构、企业、政府机关等从事心理咨询、治疗、人力资源管理、犯罪心理研究等工作，</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>八.优秀在校研究生</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>研究生积极参与实践技能大赛并取得优异成绩。现有研究生发表12篇学术论文，参加多项学术会议。2024级袁天霖获全国实践技能大赛心理治疗比赛二等奖，2023级徐艺轩和陈泓霓获三等奖，王宇泽和吴倩倩分别获国际会议优秀论文奖。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guy1RDkajHsPGz6ibcKTq5vhq5vcKqv7hpIVq3zqF7NGn5JjFBs2nhpsQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guicXsicJRtibJIAqeibvgm9XCXKeogibuhT8FN9HmsYuctfmVocXz5GpNOicg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0gu2tfFPicFQj4J1icCgMVNHI4iaLB5NFpeqico7eoPBSK0eicjowaVNSiaibwVw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0gud78vzDhw6C8NS580ob6qQAPQ3eB8H09Y1GeVsYvg3zJD5SxticMwdOg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><em><span>（左右滑动观看）</span></em></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>九.学费与学制</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>专业学位</span></strong><span>：16000元/学年</span></p><p><strong><span>学制</span></strong><span>：3年</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>十.推免面试</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>学院考核学生材料，审核通过后进行面试，面试选拔涵盖专业能力、科研能力、外语能力、综合素质能力四个维度。</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程如下：</span></strong></p><p><span>凡有意申报我院2026年推荐免试研究生的考生，即日起至</span><strong><span><span>9月14日</span></span></strong><span>，通过搜索“广州医科大学研究生院”微信小程序或扫描下面“二维码”，点击“志愿填报”进入“推免生报名信息填写”模块按要求填写提交报名信息，并由相应招生院系所组织考核，拟录取考生名单确定后，招生院系所采取“双向选择”和“内部调配”相结合的方式组织拟录取考生选报导师。</span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人需按《广州医科大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）报名公告》</span><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>https://yjs.gzhmu.edu.cn/info/1003/36682.htm）</span></strong><span>要求提交申请材料</span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>了解更多</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>请密切关注广州医科大学研究生院官网（</span><strong><span>https://yjs.gzhmu.edu.cn/index.htm</span></strong><span>）及卫生管理学院官网（</span><strong><span>https://wsgl.gzhmu.edu.cn/index.htm</span></strong><span>）及公众号。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span>来源：应用心理学系</span></p><p><span>审     核：张雪琴</span></p><p><span>文字校对：蒙    倩</span></p><p><span>本期编辑：刘红月</span></p><p><span>责任编辑：陈宇璐</span></p><p><span>投稿邮箱：gzmuhm@163.com</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9NVyoLU2Mu0PBAp7LnFZVsToY3XOO0guQTY3IhUksubg2ZXUBUUibCnY8Iu9M7vYAFticrVBRDvicQb1ZlDfInTNA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"72ac9a3078cf096364d0ccde1a09ea89ee0622857c4a53733f69243aa6faaae3","textLength":1938,"sourceSha256":"95fdf7fe712b9adcdf8ea15b8bbabd1dbe3fdee7f3b78300c91e51234eda3442","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-94d68d1dfaf47e58a609","title":"2025年广州医科大学卫生管理学院应用心理专业硕士已启动2026年招生接收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生工作","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:50.407799+00:00"}
